---
import LuxeLayout from '../layouts/LuxeLayout.astro';
---
<LuxeLayout
  title="About BathSpace by LUXEhome — Complete Bathroom Renovation"
  description="BathSpace is the bathroom renovation brand of LUXEhome (Pvt) Ltd, created to give homeowners one accountable team from planning through construction and handover."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <p class="lx-eyebrow">About BathSpace by LUXEhome</p>
    <h1>One bathroom.<br />One accountable team.</h1>
    <p>
      BathSpace is the dedicated bathroom renovation brand of LUXEhome (Pvt) Ltd.
      We plan, coordinate and deliver complete bathrooms instead of leaving the homeowner
      to manage disconnected trades and suppliers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p>Complete bathroom renovation and construction—from site assessment, design and demolition through plumbing, electrical work, waterproofing, tiling, fixtures, glass, cleaning and handover.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Why BathSpace</h2>
        <p>A bathroom is a technical wet-area project, not only a visual upgrade. One team coordinates the hidden work, sequencing, specialists, materials, testing and finish quality.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>How we work</h2>
        <p>Suitable projects begin with a complimentary consultation. After the site is understood, the detailed design and construction proposal is commissioned for LKR 50,000 and credited if BathSpace builds the bathroom.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Proof before promises</h2>
        <p>Our website is built around real completed project case studies—actual locations, actual construction scope, testing, project investment and final handover.</p>
        <a class="about-project-link" href="/projects">See completed projects →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-cta">
    <div>
      <p class="lx-eyebrow">Planning a complete bathroom?</p>
      <h2>Tell us about the project.</h2>
    </div>
    <a href="/book-site-inspection">Apply for consultation</a>
  </section>
</LuxeLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero,.about-section,.about-cta{width:min(1100px,calc(100% - 34px));margin:auto}
  .about-hero{padding:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6rem) 0 3rem}
  .about-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,8vw,5.6rem);max-width:900px;margin:.7rem 0 1.3rem}
  .about-hero>p:last-child{font:500 1.35rem/1.45 var(--lx-serif);max-width:760px}
  .about-section{padding:1.5rem 0 4rem}
  .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}
  .about-grid article{background:#fff;border:1px solid #2b322a16;border-radius:10px;padding:24px}
  .about-grid h2{font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:.7rem}
  .about-grid p{color:#586057}
  .about-project-link{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--sage-deep);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
  .about-cta{margin-bottom:4rem;background:var(--sage-deep);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:42px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
  .about-cta .lx-eyebrow{color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .about-cta h2{font-size:3rem}
  .about-cta>a{background:var(--gold);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none}
  @media(max-width:700px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.about-cta{display:block}.about-cta>a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:15px}}
</style>
